<Project>

  <!--
    Single source of truth for the product version across every project in the solution
    (Epic-013 Deployment Foundation). VSP becomes 1.0.0 only when all V1.0 GA requirements
    are complete and the Product Owner formally approves GA; see Docs/03_PRODUCT_ROADMAP.md.
    Epic-017 (Database Backup/Restore) is now Accepted/Frozen (2026-08-06), after Epic-018
    (User/Role), which had already claimed 0.18.0 first. The originally intended one-version-
    per-Epic sequence (0.17.0 reserved for Epic-017) does not fit a single Version field once
    a later-numbered Epic is accepted first — left at 0.18.0 rather than regressing it, since
    picking the next value (0.19.0? straight to 1.0.0/GA?) is a versioning-scheme decision for
    the Product Owner, not one this file should make unilaterally. Both v1.0 GA blocker Epics
    are now Accepted/Frozen; see Docs/03_PRODUCT_ROADMAP.md "Current Status" for the open
    question of when/how to formally declare v1.0 GA.
  -->
  <PropertyGroup>
    <Version>0.18.0</Version>
  </PropertyGroup>

</Project>
